      "writtenOn": "2025-03-06T14:51:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The `filter_level` search of the current frame starts around the `filter_level` of the previous frame (please check the switch case in `search_filter_level()`). Since our logic resets the `filter_level` of the current frame, the original value is backed up. The backed up values serve as the starting point for `fitler_level` search of the next frame and the search will happen around the original values.",
      "parentUuid": "08f2bfc1_f3ec402f",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 4545,
        "startChar": 6,
        "endLine": 4548,
