      "side": 1,
      "message": "This condition seems to create a chain reaction. Requiring one frame\u0027s reference filter level to be 0 requires its reference\u0027s reference filter level to be 0. Could you explain how this works? Is it likely that a leaf frame\u0027s filter level being set to 0 needs the reference at lower pyramid level to have filter_level\u003d0 as well. How does this process start? E.g. ARF frame?",
      "range": {
